    <string name="changelog_title">What\'s new</string>
    <string name="changelog">What\'s new in this version:\n\n• Redesigned login screen: modern look with floating orbs, animated pill segment and pulsing glow\n• Guest mode: enter without an account and explore the app before signing up\n• Dance/Electro mode: speeds up the music and applies a V-curve EQ for a remix feel\n• PX radio with zoom on the Trucker and Traveler channels (pinch-to-zoom)\n• Pause button on PX radio and SDR audio muted when leaving the screen\n• Live radio with Brazilian stations and online station search\n• Update download straight from the site (link validation, up-to-date notice)\n• Redesigned Profile page and more stable Virgin voice/talk-ups\n• More stable Virgin microphone (no repeated beeps or self-activation)\n• Player stability fixes and fixed update notice (reappears for each new version)\n• Fewer freezes when pausing/scrolling lists</string>
